license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/emilmsh/anonymizer"
url: "https://emilmsh.github.io/#software"
keywords:
  - anonymization
  - personal data
  - GDPR
  - qualitative data
  - large language models
abstract: >-
  A skill for the AI tools Claude Code, Codex and OpenCode that anonymizes
  interviews, meeting notes and open-ended survey answers before analysis. A
  language model at an approved provider writes change lists under project
  rules, scripts apply and check them, and a human decides whether the data is
  suitable and approves the assessment.
